<title>UK: UK delivered grain trades - Dec 20.</title>
<headline>UK delivered grain trades - Dec 20.</headline>
<text>
<p>UK grain brokers reported the following delivered grain trades at 1515 gmt, in Sterling a tonne -</p>
<p>Milling wheat 11 pct protein to Liverpool Jan 119.50 Feb 120.50</p>
<p>Tilbury Jan 115.00</p>
<p>Feed wheat to Hampshire Dec 98.00</p>
<p>Avon range Jan 99.50 Oct/Dec 99.00/99.50</p>
<p>South Wales Jan 98.50</p>
<p>Bedfordshire, Buckinghamshire, Northamptonshire and Oxfordshire Jan 96.00</p>
<p>Feed barley to Southampton Jan 100.00</p>
<p>Est Devon Jan 96.00/96.50</p>
</text>
